        <mxCell id="c115" value="&lt;i&gt;Columns D to F, H, I and K to M are hidden. Filtered for a Count above 1, which leaves only the value 2, and sorted by SupplierID and InvoiceNumber, so each of the 6 pairs sits together. Outlined: the Count column. Each pair shares a supplier and an invoice number but not the date or the amount. Blue row numbers mark a filtered Table.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="442" width="860" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
